<view class="page-wrap">
  <view class="navbar col">
    <view style="height:{{statusBarHeight}}px"></view>
    <view class="nav-inner">
      <view class="nav-back tap" hover-class="tap-press" bindtap="back">
        <text class="ficon i-right nav-back-ic"></text>
      </view>
      <view class="nav-title">隐私与数据</view>
      <view class="nav-right"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="content">
    <view class="grp-label">隐私规则</view>
    <view class="pv-group">
      <view class="pv-item tap" hover-class="tap-press" bindtap="toPolicy">
        <view class="pv-main">
          <view class="pv-t">隐私政策</view>
          <view class="pv-s">查看当前生效版本、处理目的与保存期限</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pv-go">›</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pv-item tap" hover-class="tap-press" bindtap="toDocuments">
        <view class="pv-main">
          <view class="pv-t">我的文档与到期时间</view>
          <view class="pv-s">查看服务端返回的真实文件期限并可主动删除</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pv-go">›</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="grp-label">高敏操作</view>
    <view class="pv-group">
      <view class="pv-item tap" hover-class="tap-press" bindtap="explainSensitiveAction">
        <view class="pv-main">
          <view class="pv-t">数据导出与账号注销</view>
          <view class="pv-s">需短信二次验证；本版本小程序端尚未完成安全交互</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pv-go">›</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="compliance-note">
      简历、文件和 AI 结果只服务本人，不提供给招聘企业或合作机构。岗位和招聘会仅提供来源信息入口。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
